'''Alliance''' is a [[:Category:Sweden|Swedish]] professional esports organization founded in April 2013.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2023
|name2=2024
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4

|content1=
* September 28th - '''Alliance''' enter competitive ''Counter-Strike'' with a lineup consisting of [[b0denmaster]], [[PlesseN]], [[robiin]], [[avid]], and [[twist]]. <ref name="Alliance 2023">{{cite web|url=https://thealliance.gg/alliance-x-cs2/|title=Alliance x CS2|date=2023-09-28|author=[[Kelly Ong]]|publisher='''Alliance'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 26th - '''Alliance''' sign [[Hawk]] as the team's coach. <ref name="hawk">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/theAllianceGG/status/1750934179431247938|title=Put together <nowiki>[</nowiki>A<nowiki>]</nowiki> massive ALLfam welcome for our CS coach, @Hawk_CSGO1!|date=2024-01-26|author='''Alliance'''}}</ref>
* July 22nd - '''Alliance''' bench [[robiin]]. <ref name="robiin bench">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.se/news/50836/alliance-bekraftar-robiin-bankas|title=Alliance bekräftar – robiin bänkas*|trans_title=Alliance confirms – robiin benched*|language={{Flag|se}} Swedish|date=2024-07-22|publisher=[[Dust2.se]]|author=[[quacke]]}}</ref>
* July 26th - '''Alliance''' acquire [[upE]] from [[Viperio]]. <ref name="+upe">{{cite web|url=https://viperio.com/markus-upe-johansson-transferred-to-alliance|title=Markus "upE" Johansson transferred to Alliance|date=2024-07-26|author=[[Christopher Sword]]|publisher=[[Viperio]]}}</ref>
