* December 6th - '''Alliance''' bench [[b0denmaster]]. <ref name="b0den bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/theAllianceGG/status/1865078928546664602|title=Today, we announce that Jonathan '@b0denmaster' Bodenmalm will be stepping down from our active roster and moved to the bench for the time being|date=2024-12-06|author='''Alliance'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 1st - '''Alliance''' release [[b0denmaster]]. <ref name="-b0denmaster">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/b0denmaster/status/1874427310537130328|title=As of today I’m a free agent, I’m looking to continue as AWP but I’m open for suggestions!|date=2025-01-01|author=[[b0denmaster]]}}</ref>
* January 18th - '''Alliance''' sign [[eraa]]. <ref name="+eraa">{{cite web|url=https://thealliance.gg/alliance-signs-sean-eraa-knutsson-as-new-awp-star-for-cs2-team/|title=ALLIANCE SIGNS SEAN “ERAA” KNUTSSON AS NEW AWP STAR FOR CS2 TEAM|date=2025-01-18|publisher='''Alliance'''}}</ref>
* June 26th - '''Alliance''' bench [[PlesseN]]. <ref name="PlesseN bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/theAllianceGG/status/1938266309692653594|title=An update to our CS2 roster|date=2025-06-26|author='''Alliance'''}}</ref>
* July 2nd - '''Alliance''' sign [[poiii]]. <ref name="+poiii">{{cite web|url=https://thealliance.gg/welcome-poiii/|title=ALLIANCE SIGNS ALEX "POIII" NYHOLM SUNDGREN AS NEW STAR FRAGGER FOR CS2 TEAM|date=2025-07-02|publisher='''Alliance'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 5th - [[poiii]] is acquired by [[100 Thieves]]. <ref name="-poiii">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/theAllianceGG/status/2008237827243311483|title=Today we officially confirm the transfer of @poiiixd to @100T_CS|date=2026-01-05|author='''Alliance'''}}</ref>
* January 22nd - '''Alliance''' acquire [[MaiL09]] on loan from [[Metizport]] until the end of June. <ref name="+mail09">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/theAllianceGG/status/2014284543390564666|title=Today we officially welcome prodigy @MaiL09cs on a season long loan from @Metizport|date=2026-01-22|author='''Alliance'''}}</ref>
* June 10th - '''Alliance''' part ways with [[MaiL09]] following the end of his loan from [[Metizport]]. <ref name="-mail09">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/theAllianceGG/status/2064664105613492586|title=Today our loan spell with @MaiL09cs comes to an end|date=2026-06-10|author='''Alliance'''}}</ref>
* June 12th - '''Alliance''' acquire [[bobeksde]] from [[EYEBALLERS]]. <ref name="+bobeksde">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/theAllianceGG/status/2065391211716792667|title=ALLIANCE SIGNS JONATAN "BOBEKSDE" PERSSON AS NEW ENTRY FRAGGER FOR CS2 TEAM|date=2026-06-12|author='''Alliance'''}}</ref>
