'''Alter Ego''' is an [[:Category:Indonesia|Indonesian]] esports organization founded in 2017.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2018
|name2=2019
|name3=2024
|name4=2025
|name5=2026
|This=5

|content1=
*May 17th - '''Alter Ego''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' with a roster consisting of [[alessa]], [[voogy]], [[ValdrieN]], [[Tsukamoto]], and [[Vespira]]. <ref name="csgo">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/alteregoesportsid/posts/235284810384257|title=Division Announcement!|language={{Flag|id}} Indonesian|date=2018-05-17|author='''Alter Ego'''}}</ref>
*October 9th - '''Alter Ego''' part ways with [[areel]] and sign [[sofriments]]. <ref name="-areel">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/alteregoesportsid/posts/pfbid02T2hdR3MnBiRiZBcRBqUcGTkuWsq4EBC3ZpnFyA79CrpVUJ67FuQT55ASPPVSfRd6l|title=Farewell Hazreel "areel" Mazlan!|date=2018-10-09|language={{Flag|id}} Indonesian|author='''Alter Ego'''}}</ref><ref name="+sofriments">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/alteregoesportsid/posts/pfbid02BZ6x9KC7v5Mp89YVpx5pGPVgdNBApe9NbHpTbLC43nD2kd1FGtsCTCrUF96bidnal|title=Welcome to the family Sofriments!|date=2018-10-09|language={{Flag|id}} Indonesian|author='''Alter Ego'''}}</ref>

|content2=
*January 9th - '''Alter Ego''' sign [[LurkZz]]. <ref name="+lurkzz">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/alteregoesportsid/posts/pfbid02x5GRjxWJSkivF6Y81DSRYh4FGkQwKraKHjxNADtWN5Cv6tf6FX9KHVa95tYahjnpl|title=Welcome to the family LurkZz!|date=2019-01-09|language={{Flag|id}} Indonesian|author='''Alter Ego'''}}</ref>
*April 28th - '''Alter Ego''' part ways with their lineup. <ref name="-csgo">{{cite_web|url=https://www.revivaltv.id/berita/alter-ego-esports-resmi-angkat-kaki-dari-ranah-csgo|trans_title=Alter Ego Esports Officially Leaves the CS:GO Realm!|language={{Flag|id}} Indonesian|title=Alter Ego Esports Resmi Angkat Kaki dari Ranah CS:GO!|date=2019-04-28|publisher=[[RevivalTV]]}}</ref>

