* August 18th - [[alex666]] is acquired by [[MelBet Team]]. <ref name="-alex666">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/melbet_esports/5|title=Представляем наш ростер по CS:GO — MelBet Team!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Introducing our CS:GO roster — MelBet Team!|date=2023-08-18|author=[[MelBet Team]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 19th - '''B8''' bench [[amster]]. <ref name="amster bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/B8esportsGG/status/1748415957393973512|title=CS2 Roster News!|date=2024-01-19|author='''B8'''}}</ref>
* January 22nd - '''B8''' sign [[esenthial]]. <ref name="+esenthial">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/B8esportsGG/status/1749381366695825702|title=Team Updates!|date=2024-01-22|author='''B8'''}}</ref>
* March 16th - '''B8''' release [[amster]]. <ref name="-amster">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/B8esportsGG/status/1769008563458879514|title=Amster became a free agent|date=2024-03-16|author='''B8'''}}</ref>
* April 2nd - [[r1nkle]] is acquired by [[Ninjas in Pyjamas]]. <ref name="-r1nkle">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/B8esportsGG/status/1775148218256379962|title=Our journey in CS started with a young team full of Ukrainian talents, but there was one very special guy|date=2024-04-02|author='''B8'''}}</ref>
* April 5th - '''B8''' acquire [[headtr1ck]] and [[baz]] from [[Ninjas in Pyjamas]] and [[Team Spirit Academy]], respectively. <ref name="+ua duo">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/B8esportsGG/status/1776246677478764986|title=@headtr1ckcs and Oleg «baz» have joined the B8 CS2 Squad|date=2024-04-05|author='''B8'''}}</ref>
* April 12th - '''B8''' bench [[OWNER]]. <ref name="owner bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/B8esportsGG/status/1778881317536424177|title=OWNER taking a step back and is now open to new opportunities|date=2024-04-12|author='''B8'''}}</ref>
* April 30th - '''B8''' acquire [[alex666]] from [[Betera Esports]]. <ref name="+alex666">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/betera_esports/status/1785368573419954340|title=Alexey @alex666cs Yarmoshchuk is leaving the ranks of Betera and joining @B8esportsGG|date=2024-04-30|author=[[Betera Esports]]}}</ref>
* May 7th - '''B8''' release [[OWNER]]. <ref name="-owner">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/b8esportsgg/status/1787835724173099294|title=OWNER thanks again, bro|date=2024-05-07|author='''B8'''}}</ref>
* December 28th - '''B8''' part ways with [[cptkurtka023]] and acquire [[kensizor]] from [[kONO.ECF]] as his replacement. <ref name="-cpt">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/B8esportsGG/status/1873057066643755255|title=We’re saying goodbye to @cptkurtka023 as he takes the next step in his journey|date=2024-12-28|author='''B8'''}}</ref><ref name="+kensizor">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/B8esportsGG/status/1873034326641918468|title=One more Ukrainian in our squad – welcome kensizor to B8 CS2|date=2024-12-28|author='''B8'''}}</ref>

|content5=
* August 4th - '''B8''' acquire [[npl]] from [[Natus Vincere]] on a permanent basis. <ref name="+npl permanent">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/B8esportsGG/status/1952369425258086612|title=It’s been a little over two years since Andrii “npl” Kukharskyi joined us on loan from @natusvincere|date=2025-08-04|author='''B8'''}}</ref>

|content6=
* January 16th - '''B8''' bench and transfer-list [[headtr1ck]]. <ref name="headtr1ck bench">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/B8esportsGG/status/2012231929710436761|title=We’d like to share a small update regarding Danya headtr1ck|date=2026-01-16|author='''B8'''}}</ref>
* February 1st - '''B8''' acquire [[s1zzi]] on loan from [[Team Spirit Academy Black]]. <ref name="+s1zzi">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/b8esportsgg/status/2017976369422967141|title=Roster update|date=2026-02-01|author='''B8'''}}</ref>
* March 11th - '''B8''' release [[headtr1ck]]. <ref name="-headtr1ck">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/B8esportsGG/status/2031735092234608934|title=Danya @headtr1ckcs officially becomes a free agent|date=2026-03-11|author='''B8'''}}</ref>
}}

